    "description": "All requests for the go-ecomm microservices platform. Every operation is sent to the single GraphQL gateway at {{baseUrl}}/graphql (POST). Folders are grouped by service: Account, Catalog, Order.\n\nThe `Create Account`, `Create Product`, and `Create Order` requests automatically capture the returned `id` into collection variables (`accountId`, `productId`, `orderId`) via test scripts, so you can run them in order and the Get requests will just work.",
